WEBVTT

00:19.020 --> 00:21.860
(Listening to the Stream)

00:23.070 --> 00:24.760
Don't cry, okay?

00:24.830 --> 00:26.890
I will play the rattle drum for you,
how about that?

00:31.640 --> 00:32.520
Time for sleep.

00:37.350 --> 00:37.840
Be good.

00:41.430 --> 00:42.240
He's asleep?

00:42.560 --> 00:42.920
Here.

00:53.280 --> 00:55.040
Soothing these two little ones

00:55.104 --> 00:57.680
is harder than deploying troops
and drawing up battle formations.

00:58.448 --> 00:59.790
You've worked so hard, darling.

01:00.320 --> 01:00.920
Hubby,

01:02.000 --> 01:03.710
I've had an idea recently.

01:03.880 --> 01:04.430
Tell me.

01:05.510 --> 01:07.560
I want our two children...

01:08.510 --> 01:10.840
one to be a scholar,
and the other a warrior.

01:10.880 --> 01:12.070
They'll complement each other.

01:12.510 --> 01:13.430
What do you think?

01:14.352 --> 01:15.870
You've thought this through carefully.

01:16.230 --> 01:17.150
I'll do as you say.

01:21.870 --> 01:22.760
Then,

01:23.590 --> 01:24.280
what about us?

01:34.992 --> 01:37.590
Since Shen Shijiu has already
married Xiao Wenxi in my place,

01:37.950 --> 01:38.790
I've decided

01:38.848 --> 01:41.680
to assume the identity of the long-lost
sister of the Marquis of Shunan

01:41.840 --> 01:42.480
and marry you.

01:43.280 --> 01:45.070
That way, we can be
a real husband and wife.

01:50.350 --> 01:51.590
For a lifetime,

01:52.710 --> 01:53.790
my heart will never change.

02:09.750 --> 02:10.310
Listen.

02:14.800 --> 02:15.400
What is it?

02:16.280 --> 02:18.470
That bird's call sounds like Baisui.

02:20.912 --> 02:22.770
We've been living
in seclusion in this paradise

02:22.784 --> 02:24.030
for almost a year now.

02:24.048 --> 02:26.288
We haven't had any news
from the imperial capital.

02:27.030 --> 02:29.150
I wonder how Xihe is doing,

02:29.470 --> 02:31.430
and how the Crown Prince's health is.

02:31.552 --> 02:32.960
If you're worried and concerned,

02:33.590 --> 02:34.240
tomorrow,

02:34.784 --> 02:36.470
I'll find a way
to contact Zhao Zhenghao.

02:39.840 --> 02:40.800
Be good.

02:40.800 --> 02:41.870
Don't cry.

02:42.240 --> 02:42.870
Don't cry.

02:42.870 --> 02:44.432
- There, there. Don't cry.
- Don't cry.

02:45.310 --> 02:45.680
Here.

02:45.680 --> 02:46.400
Such good boys.

02:46.400 --> 02:48.096
I will play with the rattle drum
with you.

02:48.430 --> 02:49.240
Be good.

04:14.912 --> 04:15.720
=Blossoms of Power=

04:15.728 --> 04:18.620
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

04:18.700 --> 04:21.660
=Episode 34=

04:21.860 --> 04:26.260
(Sixian Hall)

04:36.544 --> 04:37.950
- What are you doing?
- Don't move.

04:38.016 --> 04:38.850
- Don't move.
- Go.

04:38.920 --> 04:39.920
- Go.
- Let go of me!

04:40.000 --> 04:41.120
- Let go of me!
- Behave!

04:41.952 --> 04:43.040
What are you all doing?

04:43.800 --> 04:44.480
Let go of me!

04:44.480 --> 04:45.190
(Sixian Hall)
Don't move.

04:45.190 --> 04:45.720
Don't move.

04:47.270 --> 04:48.120
Let go of me!

04:58.190 --> 04:59.480
Prince Xin, on what grounds

04:59.536 --> 05:00.992
have you had my men seized?

05:06.120 --> 05:08.000
Now that Father is bedridden,

05:08.096 --> 05:09.936
a new rule has been issued
in the palace.

05:10.160 --> 05:11.270
The guards on duty

05:12.120 --> 05:13.920
are to be rotated every three months.

05:15.360 --> 05:16.240
Tian Yuan,

05:17.120 --> 05:18.480
the guards of the East Palace

05:18.832 --> 05:20.928
haven't been rotated in a long time,
have they?

05:30.270 --> 05:31.240
From this day forward,

05:31.600 --> 05:33.648
they will be on duty
with the Imperial Guard.

05:33.664 --> 05:36.064
They are forbidden from setting foot
in the palace again.

05:37.920 --> 05:38.800
Do you think

05:39.750 --> 05:40.830
that by replacing my men,

05:41.360 --> 05:42.750
you've cut off my arms and legs?

05:43.830 --> 05:46.160
When it comes to you,
of course I have to be thorough.

05:54.272 --> 05:55.750
If it's just a rotation of guards,

05:56.920 --> 05:58.800
there's no reason to tie them up.

06:03.180 --> 06:06.260
(Sixian Hall)

06:11.820 --> 06:15.180
(Sixian Hall)

06:15.232 --> 06:16.768
The importance of the East Palace

06:17.392 --> 06:18.950
lies in upholding rules and etiquette.

06:20.000 --> 06:20.680
Tian Yuan,

06:21.600 --> 06:23.160
all of you will go for three months.

06:23.830 --> 06:24.800
When the time is up,

06:26.000 --> 06:27.630
you must all return safe and sound.

06:29.536 --> 06:30.448
Yes, Your Highness.

06:32.750 --> 06:33.360
Let's go!

06:45.600 --> 06:46.950
What is it you truly want?

06:51.540 --> 06:54.940
(Sixian Hall)

06:59.216 --> 07:01.310
I want to be the father
of the child in your womb.

07:03.750 --> 07:05.070
You're truly insane.

07:06.480 --> 07:08.480
Now that I can even
obtain the entire world,

07:09.830 --> 07:11.240
is there anything I cannot have?

07:11.390 --> 07:13.430
I never imagined your grand ambition

07:13.720 --> 07:16.190
was to be recorded by historians
as a treacherous rebel.

07:20.680 --> 07:22.800
You have more courage than a man.

07:23.680 --> 07:25.480
You're not one to fear rumors.

07:26.190 --> 07:27.240
Besides,

07:27.616 --> 07:29.568
it is up to me to decide
how history books

07:30.680 --> 07:32.040
should be written from now on.

07:33.510 --> 07:34.870
You obtained the imperial seal

07:36.040 --> 07:38.360
just to satisfy
your own twisted ambitions.

07:40.160 --> 07:42.430
I'm just putting everything back
in its rightful place.

07:43.160 --> 07:44.240
You left me before

07:44.240 --> 07:45.750
because I couldn't protect you.

07:46.190 --> 07:47.800
Later, you married Xiao Huayong

07:47.800 --> 07:49.870
because of his status
as the legitimate heir.

07:51.360 --> 07:52.920
Now, I have everything.

07:52.960 --> 07:54.320
For you to come back to my side

07:54.384 --> 07:55.408
is only natural.

07:55.950 --> 07:56.600
Isn't it?

07:58.430 --> 07:59.000
By the way,

07:59.104 --> 08:01.890
I've instructed the Ministry of
Rites and the Imperial Wardrobe Service

08:01.904 --> 08:04.048
to prepare for the wedding ceremony
and your gown.

08:04.352 --> 08:06.120
You don't need to worry
about the formalities

08:06.120 --> 08:07.190
of betrothal and inquiries.

08:07.190 --> 08:08.800
Leave everything to me.

08:22.000 --> 08:22.720
Changqing,

08:23.392 --> 08:24.830
what in the world are you doing?

08:27.390 --> 08:29.040
I'm going to marry Shen Xihe.

08:29.870 --> 08:30.950
After the ceremony is over,

08:31.800 --> 08:33.080
I will of course let you out.

08:33.870 --> 08:35.270
She is the Crown Princess.

08:35.344 --> 08:37.344
This is a flagrant disregard
for morality!

08:41.390 --> 08:43.360
She has always been my wife.

08:44.390 --> 08:45.150
Rest assured,

08:45.936 --> 08:48.448
I will give her the very best
of everything in this world.

08:54.240 --> 08:55.000
Watch him closely.

08:55.200 --> 08:55.750
- Yes.
- Yes.

08:55.750 --> 08:56.390
Changqing!

08:56.510 --> 08:57.270
Changqing!

08:58.390 --> 08:59.440
Xiao Changqing!

08:59.670 --> 09:00.790
Xiao Changqing!

09:00.880 --> 09:02.790
(Life Flourishes in Splendor)
You can't do this!

09:03.270 --> 09:04.360
Changqing!

09:10.540 --> 09:12.980
(Clarity and Serenity)

09:39.030 --> 09:39.960
Your Highness,

09:40.000 --> 09:42.320
none of the guards inside
and outside the East Palace now

09:42.320 --> 09:43.750
are our people.

09:43.856 --> 09:45.056
The palace maids and eunuchs

09:45.060 --> 09:46.990
are interrogated every time
they enter or leave.

09:47.000 --> 09:48.550
Where they're going, what they're doing,

09:48.550 --> 09:49.750
what they're carrying,

09:49.750 --> 09:50.870
everything is inspected.

09:51.000 --> 09:52.720
Not even Mo Yu and I are exempt.

09:53.080 --> 09:55.270
This is no better than being in prison.

10:06.870 --> 10:08.390
Youyou, you are exceptionally clever.

10:08.510 --> 10:09.120
This time,

10:09.232 --> 10:10.670
I must inspect the pieces carefully,

10:10.840 --> 10:12.910
lest you tamper with them again.

10:13.600 --> 10:15.360
You must inspect them thoroughly.

10:16.630 --> 10:18.240
Don't be a sore loser.

10:29.344 --> 10:32.080
Youyou, you truly live up
to your name as a general's daughter.

10:32.224 --> 10:33.600
A game of Go is like a battlefield.

10:34.150 --> 10:37.200
You fully grasp the principle of
encircling with 10, attacking with five.

10:38.030 --> 10:39.270
I'm truly in a bind.

10:40.630 --> 10:42.600
If I'm inferior to you in every way,

10:42.600 --> 10:43.600
one day,

10:43.720 --> 10:45.240
you might grow tired of me.

10:45.440 --> 10:46.630
What would I do then?

10:54.030 --> 10:58.360
Your tactic of creating a diversion
to conceal your true goal

10:58.360 --> 10:59.390
is just as impressive.

11:00.910 --> 11:01.630
I've lost.

11:03.720 --> 11:04.910
Then I'll punish you

11:05.200 --> 11:06.240
by having you make

11:06.510 --> 11:07.720
another bowl of wontons for me.

11:09.320 --> 11:12.200
I'm turning
into the East Palace's personal cook.

11:22.270 --> 11:23.630
Create a diversion

11:24.440 --> 11:25.750
and conceal the true goal.

11:28.600 --> 11:29.630
We, as husband and wife,

11:31.240 --> 11:32.240
were always of one mind.

11:36.670 --> 11:37.360
Mo Yu,

11:38.080 --> 11:39.440
find someone and tell Prince Xin

11:40.120 --> 11:40.790
that tomorrow,

11:41.120 --> 11:42.440
I am going to Fahua Temple.

11:44.550 --> 11:45.030
Yes.

11:56.510 --> 11:57.840
Why the sudden urge

11:58.750 --> 11:59.840
to go to Fahua Temple?

12:17.750 --> 12:18.840
These past few days,

12:19.120 --> 12:20.150
I've been restless.

12:21.088 --> 12:22.600
I keep dreaming of the Crown Prince.

12:22.768 --> 12:25.088
When the deceased appears frequently
in one's dreams,

12:25.104 --> 12:26.992
it may be that their soul
is not at peace.

12:27.080 --> 12:28.496
I want to go and pay my respects.

12:30.150 --> 12:31.440
If you're not sleeping well,

12:31.888 --> 12:33.390
I can have
the imperial physician prescribe

12:33.390 --> 12:35.380
some medicine to calm your nerves
and help you sleep.

12:35.390 --> 12:37.430
The imperial physician
said I'm grieving too much,

12:37.440 --> 12:38.768
and my heart is heavy with sorrow.

12:39.550 --> 12:40.630
If this continues,

12:41.240 --> 12:43.790
it will be detrimental to me
and the child

12:44.120 --> 12:44.840
in my womb.

12:45.790 --> 12:47.360
Fahua Temple is far away.

12:47.920 --> 12:50.080
I'm afraid the journey
will be exhausting for you.

12:50.480 --> 12:51.870
As the months go by,

12:52.360 --> 12:53.910
my energy will only wane.

12:54.448 --> 12:55.840
While I'm still in the early stages,

12:56.120 --> 12:57.870
I want to bring our child to him.

12:59.150 --> 13:00.080
You know,

13:01.480 --> 13:02.630
I don't want to hear this.

13:05.240 --> 13:08.120
This is a family matter
for my husband, my child, and me.

13:08.840 --> 13:10.600
You manage state affairs.

13:10.960 --> 13:13.136
Must you meddle
in my family matters as well?

13:16.480 --> 13:17.030
All right.

13:19.390 --> 13:20.630
If you're feeling uneasy,

13:21.670 --> 13:22.870
then go and offer some incense.

13:24.080 --> 13:24.790
I'll go with you.

13:26.080 --> 13:27.480
I can take care of myself.

13:27.960 --> 13:28.840
Don't worry.

13:29.630 --> 13:30.790
If I don't go with you,

13:32.360 --> 13:33.630
I won't be at ease either.

13:38.720 --> 13:41.150
If you are truly so suspicious,

13:41.320 --> 13:42.670
all the arrangements for the trip

13:43.080 --> 13:44.200
can be made by you.

13:51.150 --> 13:52.200
Excellent.

13:54.140 --> 13:59.020
(Shijia Pagoda)

14:32.550 --> 14:33.510
Holy Buddha,

14:33.776 --> 14:36.080
please convey a few words
on my behalf to my husband.

14:36.440 --> 14:37.270
Winter has come.

14:38.200 --> 14:41.200
The persimmon tree we planted
has borne fruit.

14:41.750 --> 14:43.240
Zhen Zhu, Mo Yu, and I

14:43.360 --> 14:45.150
dried the persimmons into cakes.

14:45.510 --> 14:46.670
They are very sweet.

14:48.270 --> 14:50.480
I brought some for you to try.

14:52.080 --> 14:54.440
The leaves
of the ginkgo tree have fallen.

14:55.670 --> 14:57.320
I found the best leaves

14:58.080 --> 14:59.750
and made a new pillow for you.

15:01.440 --> 15:03.550
Also, your favorite Wuyang tea.

15:04.240 --> 15:05.550
I brewed it in advance.

15:05.960 --> 15:08.870
Its fragrance still lingers.

15:10.840 --> 15:11.840
Your affection

15:13.240 --> 15:14.510
will surely reach Huayong.

15:16.960 --> 15:18.240
I once came here

15:20.320 --> 15:21.870
and prayed countless times

15:23.000 --> 15:24.840
to see my wife again

15:25.600 --> 15:26.840
and to be reunited with her.

15:28.790 --> 15:30.000
The Buddha here

15:31.510 --> 15:32.910
really answers prayers.

15:42.704 --> 15:44.080
Your hands are red from the cold.

15:46.550 --> 15:48.120
Your Highness, you needn't worry.

15:57.750 --> 15:59.390
From now on, whatever you do,

16:01.320 --> 16:02.960
I can go along with your wishes.

16:05.550 --> 16:06.670
But there is one thing

16:09.240 --> 16:10.480
you cannot refuse me.

16:11.120 --> 16:12.240
Do you really think

16:12.624 --> 16:14.360
that threats will get you what you want?

16:19.030 --> 16:20.440
I will ask the Buddha

16:22.150 --> 16:23.720
to bless our family of three.

16:25.080 --> 16:26.120
Your child

16:26.750 --> 16:28.030
is my child.

16:31.030 --> 16:32.320
I will treat the child as my own.

16:35.240 --> 16:37.870
For you to say such things
in this holy Buddhist place,

16:38.550 --> 16:40.870
how can the Buddha possibly bless you?

16:42.630 --> 16:43.630
Without you,

16:46.240 --> 16:47.840
I am the one forsaken by the gods

16:48.032 --> 16:49.550
and my future is bleak and uncertain.

17:30.960 --> 17:32.000
Your Highness,

17:32.350 --> 17:33.590
are you all right?

17:34.590 --> 17:35.350
I'm fine.

17:36.160 --> 17:38.750
Youyou and Luming,

17:38.880 --> 17:41.680
you are perfectly matched.

18:02.350 --> 18:03.590
Although this is a risky gambit,

18:04.750 --> 18:06.030
you believe I can win.

18:07.960 --> 18:08.550
Right?

18:19.640 --> 18:20.550
Today,

18:20.704 --> 18:23.024
I have invited all of you, my ministers,
to my residence

18:23.680 --> 18:24.880
to announce

18:25.400 --> 18:27.480
my marriage to the daughter
of the Duke of Wei.

18:29.872 --> 18:30.992
The wedding invitations

18:31.040 --> 18:33.510
will be delivered to your residences
in the coming days.

18:33.750 --> 18:34.920
Your Highness,

18:38.030 --> 18:39.510
allow us to say something.

18:40.550 --> 18:42.440
The Crown Prince died
while saving His Majesty.

18:43.000 --> 18:45.790
But the Duke of Wei's daughter
is still the Crown Princess.

18:46.030 --> 18:47.480
And she is with child.

18:47.750 --> 18:49.200
For you to marry her

18:49.400 --> 18:51.750
goes against the rites
and ethics of our dynasty.

19:00.400 --> 19:01.830
Your Highness, what are you doing?

19:02.208 --> 19:04.830
For so many years, we have risked
our lives for the Rong family.

19:05.240 --> 19:06.510
Do you

19:07.000 --> 19:08.640
resort to killing us?

19:16.512 --> 19:18.830
The eldest son of Minister Ren
of the Ministry of Personnel

19:18.864 --> 19:21.190
colluded with salt smugglers
from the two river regions.

19:21.200 --> 19:22.550
Using twelve official ships,

19:22.680 --> 19:24.480
he smuggled 30,000 jin of illicit salt.

19:24.830 --> 19:27.720
In our dynasty, salt and iron are
managed by Salt Administration.

19:27.880 --> 19:30.680
Illegally opening salt wells
and smuggling salt

19:31.088 --> 19:33.344
are punishable by execution
according to the law.

19:33.920 --> 19:36.200
The nephew of Minister Liang
of the Ministry of Revenue,

19:36.200 --> 19:38.240
under the pretext
of surveying farmlands,

19:38.240 --> 19:40.920
forcibly seized over 700 qing
of fertile land in Heyang County.

19:40.920 --> 19:42.848
The commoners Lv Zheng,
Dong Qi, and Miao Anping

19:42.864 --> 19:45.000
jointly filed a complaint
at the prefectural office,

19:45.088 --> 19:47.350
but were intercepted
and beaten to death with clubs.

19:47.440 --> 19:49.270
Minister Chen of the Palace Secretariat,

19:49.270 --> 19:50.740
who is in charge of the palace guards,

19:50.750 --> 19:53.030
has been privately selling positions
in the Imperial Guard.

19:53.056 --> 19:55.000
He has already accepted 25 kg of gold.

19:55.510 --> 19:56.590
My dear ministers,

19:57.264 --> 19:59.472
you've all followed the Rong family
for years,

19:59.830 --> 20:00.750
and are also

20:00.830 --> 20:02.200
people of honor and propriety.

20:02.680 --> 20:03.750
If you have any advice,

20:04.000 --> 20:05.880
I am always open to it.

20:06.480 --> 20:07.270
However,

20:08.830 --> 20:10.440
if anyone has,

20:11.880 --> 20:13.920
regarding my marriage
to the Duke of Wei's daughter,

20:15.240 --> 20:16.550
any further objections,

20:19.920 --> 20:22.110
I will make sure they die
without a grave.

20:36.030 --> 20:36.790
Qingqing,

20:38.592 --> 20:40.590
this is the betrothal gift
I prepared for you.

20:41.776 --> 20:43.880
It's exactly the same
as the one from back then.

20:45.720 --> 20:46.960
Your Highness,

20:47.680 --> 20:50.000
how long will you
keep deceiving yourself?

20:58.640 --> 20:59.920
I've been thinking

21:01.310 --> 21:02.920
about what exactly I need to do

21:05.350 --> 21:07.200
for us to be together again.

21:09.640 --> 21:10.400
So,

21:11.440 --> 21:12.680
I'm using our

21:12.830 --> 21:14.070
original way

21:14.920 --> 21:16.200
to marry you once more.

21:22.550 --> 21:23.550
Your Highness,

21:23.720 --> 21:25.984
His Majesty summons the Crown Princess
to the palace.

21:51.110 --> 21:51.790
Your Majesty,

21:51.936 --> 21:53.520
the Crown Princess has arrived.

21:54.030 --> 21:55.070
Send her in.

22:05.790 --> 22:06.960
Greetings, Your Majesty.

22:08.000 --> 22:09.920
Come closer.

22:10.656 --> 22:11.664
Yes, Your Majesty.

22:25.072 --> 22:27.216
Father, you have been ill
for a long time.

22:27.590 --> 22:29.000
You should be resting well.

22:30.200 --> 22:31.790
I wonder what is the matter today

22:32.030 --> 22:33.270
that you summoned me.

22:36.000 --> 22:37.000
I know

22:38.000 --> 22:40.920
my own body better than anyone.

22:42.750 --> 22:44.880
It is beyond cure.

22:46.070 --> 22:47.240
It's just

22:47.920 --> 22:49.590
that I still have one

22:50.200 --> 22:52.350
unfulfilled wish.

22:55.480 --> 22:57.000
It's Huayong.

22:58.110 --> 22:59.830
When he was dying,

23:00.200 --> 23:02.350
the only thing he begged of me

23:03.000 --> 23:07.750
was to bestow a name
upon the child in your womb.

23:10.030 --> 23:11.400
I know

23:12.110 --> 23:14.880
the only thing
Huayong couldn't let go of

23:15.510 --> 23:17.880
was you and your child.

23:18.830 --> 23:20.790
His greatest wish

23:21.240 --> 23:25.160
was for you both to be safe and sound.

23:28.110 --> 23:28.790
Your Majesty.

23:28.880 --> 23:30.340
Hurry, summon the imperial physician!

23:30.350 --> 23:31.510
There's no need.

23:33.200 --> 23:34.400
There's no need.

23:35.880 --> 23:37.240
Huayong.

23:38.590 --> 23:40.310
My Huayong

23:43.160 --> 23:45.590
is the Daxing Dynasty's

23:47.200 --> 23:49.680
legitimate bloodline,

23:52.310 --> 23:54.110
the Crown Prince of the East Palace.

24:00.480 --> 24:01.440
Xihe,

24:02.830 --> 24:04.640
the child in your womb

24:05.550 --> 24:08.070
is his only bloodline,

24:09.030 --> 24:11.790
and my own imperial grandson.

24:13.310 --> 24:14.790
I summoned you today

24:15.750 --> 24:16.510
because I

24:17.750 --> 24:19.030
just want

24:19.750 --> 24:21.510
to fulfill his wish

24:22.680 --> 24:25.510
and issue an edict
to name my imperial grandson.

24:26.160 --> 24:27.880
The child in your womb,

24:28.880 --> 24:30.070
I bestow the name

24:31.720 --> 24:32.920
Junshu.

24:35.904 --> 24:37.400
I've also thought of a formal name.

24:38.920 --> 24:39.790
Xiao Junshu.

24:40.270 --> 24:41.960
The name Junshu

24:41.960 --> 24:43.480
implies one who governs the state.

24:44.110 --> 24:45.480
That carries too much weight.

24:45.640 --> 24:47.070
Will Father agree to it?

24:47.160 --> 24:47.830
Trust me,

24:48.680 --> 24:49.590
he will agree.

25:03.740 --> 25:07.020
(Imperial Edict)

25:12.030 --> 25:13.240
Pass on the decree.

25:14.160 --> 25:15.880
Order the Directorate of Astronomy

25:18.110 --> 25:20.240
to choose an auspicious day.

25:21.110 --> 25:25.550
The Minister of Rites,
assisted by the Chief Minister

25:26.310 --> 25:30.960
will preside over the grand ceremony
to invest the Imperial Grandson.

25:32.400 --> 25:34.510
- I receive the decree.
- I receive the decree.

25:37.296 --> 25:39.216
Thank you for your profound grace,
Your Majesty.

25:46.860 --> 25:49.104
(Special Edict: The child born to
Crown Princess, regardless of gender,)

25:49.104 --> 25:51.660
(is named Junshu and established as
Imperial Grandson to succeed the throne.)

26:40.310 --> 26:41.960
I heard His Majesty issued an edict.

26:42.240 --> 26:43.440
Where is the edict?

26:46.000 --> 26:47.160
Noble Consort Rong,

26:47.310 --> 26:49.350
His Majesty has issued
an imperial decree

26:49.350 --> 26:52.510
bestowing the name Junshu upon
the unborn child of the Crown Princess.

26:52.750 --> 26:54.000
If a boy is born,

26:54.010 --> 26:56.430
he shall be invested as the
Imperial Grandson and primary heir

26:56.440 --> 26:57.720
to succeed the throne.

26:58.310 --> 27:01.000
The edict is with Her Highness,
the Crown Princess...

27:01.000 --> 27:01.510
Insolent!

27:04.830 --> 27:05.960
I am here.

27:06.310 --> 27:07.720
How dare you speak out of turn?

27:08.240 --> 27:10.000
The imperial edict
has not yet been read.

27:10.270 --> 27:11.680
I have not seen it myself.

27:12.672 --> 27:13.960
How can it be considered valid?

27:14.672 --> 27:16.000
Calm yourself, Your Highness.

27:16.550 --> 27:19.000
The Minister of Rites,
the Directorate of Astronomy

27:19.100 --> 27:21.350
and the ministers
of the Court of Imperial Clan Affairs

27:21.350 --> 27:23.184
were all personally appointed
by His Majesty.

27:23.240 --> 27:26.200
They are the regents meant
to assist the Imperial Grandson.

27:27.640 --> 27:29.640
As for the edict
His Majesty issued today,

27:29.640 --> 27:31.200
we can all bear witness to it.

27:31.520 --> 27:33.680
- We can all bear witness.
- We can all bear witness.

27:34.240 --> 27:34.960
Guards!

27:35.070 --> 27:35.640
- Yes!
- Yes!

27:37.440 --> 27:39.400
Escort these officials out.

27:39.830 --> 27:41.920
Keep them with the other ministers.

27:42.240 --> 27:42.790
- Yes.
- Yes.

27:46.440 --> 27:46.960
Go.

27:47.590 --> 27:48.070
Go.

27:53.776 --> 27:56.080
Noble Consort Rong,
are you trying to stage a coup?

28:01.400 --> 28:03.440
His Majesty's health
was already improving.

28:04.830 --> 28:05.960
Shen Xihe.

28:07.400 --> 28:09.640
But you held His Majesty hostage

28:10.350 --> 28:11.790
and forged the imperial edict.

28:13.000 --> 28:14.310
Since you have doubts,

28:14.544 --> 28:16.864
you should follow
the ancestral customs all the more.

28:17.184 --> 28:18.880
Wait for all the ministers to assemble

28:19.310 --> 28:21.000
and read the edict publicly.

28:24.080 --> 28:24.830
Your Highness,

28:25.088 --> 28:26.510
our men have surrounded the palace.

28:28.270 --> 28:29.830
So you knew all along

28:30.790 --> 28:32.350
that His Majesty summoned me today

28:32.480 --> 28:34.000
to name an heir.

28:34.400 --> 28:35.880
You've been preparing for this.

28:46.590 --> 28:47.960
The Crown Prince has passed away.

28:48.464 --> 28:50.240
The foundation of the state is unstable.

28:50.550 --> 28:51.440
I,

28:51.440 --> 28:52.680
as a Noble Consort,

28:52.680 --> 28:54.720
for the sake of the Daxing Empire,

28:54.830 --> 28:56.784
must naturally be thorough
in my considerations.

28:57.550 --> 28:59.000
The position of Crown Prince

28:59.000 --> 29:00.416
is tied to the fate of the nation.

29:00.480 --> 29:01.880
How can it be entrusted

29:02.160 --> 29:05.550
to an unborn child?

29:16.020 --> 29:20.940
(Chenning Hall)

29:37.660 --> 29:44.300
(Taiji Hall)

29:48.790 --> 29:50.920
By order of Prince Xin,

29:51.240 --> 29:53.440
His Majesty is unwell.

29:53.680 --> 29:56.350
All ministers are ordered
to enter the palace

29:56.510 --> 29:59.880
to pray for His Majesty's well-being.

30:40.400 --> 30:41.880
Who sent you?

30:42.110 --> 30:44.270
How dare you draw your blades
on court officials?

30:59.350 --> 31:00.200
Everyone,

31:01.000 --> 31:02.240
remain calm,

31:02.510 --> 31:04.270
and your lives will be spared.

31:04.830 --> 31:05.920
Otherwise,

31:06.680 --> 31:08.200
you will be killed without mercy.

31:22.640 --> 31:23.680
Now,

31:23.680 --> 31:24.950
the key ministers of the court

31:24.960 --> 31:26.960
have all been invited by me
to the side hall.

31:27.640 --> 31:28.680
Shen Xihe,

31:29.110 --> 31:30.400
you've already lost.

31:31.110 --> 31:32.680
If you hand over the edict,

31:32.750 --> 31:34.640
I will grant you a white silk sash

31:34.640 --> 31:35.680
to preserve your dignity.

31:36.560 --> 31:38.240
Your maternal grandfather's Tao family

31:38.240 --> 31:39.550
and the Duke of Wei's manor

31:40.070 --> 31:41.880
may be spared.

31:42.830 --> 31:44.110
Today, I

31:44.550 --> 31:46.070
will announce to the world

31:46.720 --> 31:49.030
that my son, Prince Xin,
is virtuous and talented,

31:49.350 --> 31:50.640
and shall inherit the throne.

31:50.920 --> 31:52.480
You seem certain

31:52.760 --> 31:54.210
that victory is in your grasp.

31:56.240 --> 31:57.680
You are all alone.

31:57.680 --> 31:59.440
What do you have to fight me with?

32:00.070 --> 32:02.070
While I command a great army.

32:03.350 --> 32:04.960
Who wins and who loses,

32:05.030 --> 32:06.750
isn't it obvious at a glance?

32:13.024 --> 32:16.272
- We'll protect Crown Princess to death!
- We'll protect Crown Princess to death!

32:25.350 --> 32:27.400
And here I was wondering
who it could be.

32:27.640 --> 32:29.400
It's just this group

32:29.830 --> 32:32.640
of delicate, beautiful ladies
from the inner palace.

32:36.750 --> 32:37.480
Who dares?

32:39.310 --> 32:41.690
I am the Crown Princess
personally appointed by His Majesty.

32:42.400 --> 32:43.790
My father is the Duke of Wei.

32:43.888 --> 32:45.990
The tens of thousands
of soldiers on northwest border

32:46.030 --> 32:47.840
all take orders
from my father and brothers.

32:47.850 --> 32:49.580
My maternal family,
the Tao family of Wuxing,

32:49.590 --> 32:51.240
is a prominent clan
south of the Yangtze.

32:51.376 --> 32:54.190
Their students and former subordinates
are spread throughout the court.

32:54.310 --> 32:55.712
Before you make a move against me,

32:56.000 --> 32:57.510
have you considered the consequences?

33:00.480 --> 33:01.070
You,

33:01.880 --> 33:02.750
Captain Sun.

33:03.510 --> 33:04.750
Your father, Marshal Sun,

33:05.160 --> 33:07.110
once served under my father's command.

33:07.120 --> 33:08.790
It was my Shen family
who recommended him,

33:08.800 --> 33:10.540
allowing him to reach
his current position.

33:10.672 --> 33:13.104
Are you going to repay our kindness
with enmity?

33:14.640 --> 33:15.350
And you,

33:16.680 --> 33:17.440
Captain Li.

33:17.790 --> 33:19.240
Your esteemed brother, Commander Li,

33:19.480 --> 33:21.640
once served under my brother,
Shen Yun'an.

33:21.776 --> 33:23.424
If not for my brother's strong defense,

33:23.440 --> 33:25.470
he'd have been punished
for dereliction of duty.

33:25.480 --> 33:26.720
Has the Shen family

33:27.240 --> 33:28.750
ever treated you unfairly?

33:32.510 --> 33:33.720
Don't you forget,

33:34.310 --> 33:36.240
I am the Princess of Lanhai.

33:37.160 --> 33:38.550
Under my father, the king,

33:38.750 --> 33:40.720
are hundreds of thousands
of skilled archers.

33:41.200 --> 33:43.110
If I were to meet
an unfortunate end here today,

33:43.312 --> 33:46.000
the alliance between our two nations
would be immediately void.

33:46.200 --> 33:47.680
Once war breaks out on the border,

33:48.070 --> 33:49.030
can you afford

33:49.480 --> 33:50.720
to pay the price?

33:51.590 --> 33:53.550
For her own selfish desires,
Noble Consort Rong

33:54.000 --> 33:55.750
disregards the fate of our nation.

33:56.510 --> 33:57.440
If today,

33:57.440 --> 33:59.200
you heed her slanderous words

33:59.280 --> 34:01.440
and raise your swords
against the women of the palace,

34:01.510 --> 34:02.880
once word gets out,

34:02.960 --> 34:05.690
the northwestern tribes and the
foreign tribes of the southern desert,

34:05.720 --> 34:07.584
upon hearing of this great upheaval
in our court,

34:07.590 --> 34:09.790
will surely reignite the flames of war
on the frontiers.

34:09.880 --> 34:11.424
The cities and homes that those soldiers

34:11.440 --> 34:12.880
traded their blood to protect,

34:12.920 --> 34:15.590
the peaceful days the common people
have so desperately awaited,

34:15.960 --> 34:17.320
will all, because of you,

34:17.320 --> 34:18.400
be for nothing.

34:20.480 --> 34:23.190
The soldiers
who shed their blood alongside you,

34:23.960 --> 34:26.110
and the people you swore
to protect with your lives,

34:26.190 --> 34:27.230
how will they view

34:27.230 --> 34:28.760
your actions today?

34:28.768 --> 34:30.070
And how could you possibly face

34:30.070 --> 34:33.000
your ancestors and fallen comrades
in the afterlife?

34:34.560 --> 34:36.000
What are you standing there for?

34:37.000 --> 34:38.510
Gag them for me!

34:40.320 --> 34:41.710
Your Highness, please forgive us!

34:41.710 --> 34:43.830
- Your Highness, please forgive us!
- Your Highness, please forgive us!

34:43.840 --> 34:45.110
A bunch of useless fools.

34:46.280 --> 34:48.150
Just a few delicate women,

34:48.280 --> 34:49.670
and you're actually afraid of them?

35:00.320 --> 35:02.440
For you to be so calm,

35:02.768 --> 35:04.880
it seems you still have
another move to make.

35:08.760 --> 35:10.190
In less than an hour,

35:11.030 --> 35:12.190
this royal city

35:13.190 --> 35:14.360
will belong to us,

35:14.800 --> 35:15.960
the Rong family.

35:16.480 --> 35:18.150
It seems you'll have to use Xiao Wenxi.

35:21.400 --> 35:22.630
Shen Xihe,

35:25.000 --> 35:26.630
the final victory

35:27.550 --> 35:29.710
doesn't depend on
who has a flawless plan,

35:34.440 --> 35:36.670
but on who can control people's hearts.

35:37.840 --> 35:39.670
Xiao Wenxi remained unmarried for years,

35:40.360 --> 35:41.760
waiting for Xiao Huayong.

35:41.960 --> 35:43.760
She never stopped loving him.

35:43.760 --> 35:44.710
And you?

35:45.360 --> 35:47.110
You made her marry Bu Shulin.

35:47.400 --> 35:49.110
You stole the one she loved most.

35:49.400 --> 35:51.800
And you actually thought
she would be grateful

35:51.800 --> 35:53.150
and become your ally.

35:55.550 --> 35:57.280
But for all your scheming,

35:57.840 --> 35:59.840
you failed to account
for a woman's heart,

36:00.070 --> 36:01.360
which turns love to hate

36:01.590 --> 36:03.230
and is driven mad by jealousy.

36:08.150 --> 36:09.280
The real show

36:10.110 --> 36:11.630
is about to begin.

36:15.140 --> 36:18.900
(Residence of the Heir
of the Marquis of Shunan)

36:21.648 --> 36:23.470
The governor of Yingzhou
is asking for help.

36:23.480 --> 36:25.168
I must lead troops to reinforce them.

36:25.380 --> 36:26.180
(Bu)

36:26.190 --> 36:28.580
It's the Bu family's token
for mobilizing the household troops.

36:28.590 --> 36:30.280
I'm entrusting it to you now.

36:30.840 --> 36:32.280
You must come back alive.

36:33.760 --> 36:34.320
Take care.

36:40.380 --> 36:42.980
(Bu)

36:45.960 --> 36:46.760
The time has come.

36:46.800 --> 36:47.630
Is everything ready?

36:47.840 --> 36:49.230
Everything is ready.

36:49.400 --> 36:52.440
Young Master Bu is already
on his way to Yingzhou.

36:52.590 --> 36:53.880
I have the token.

36:54.400 --> 36:55.440
Are the men all here?

36:55.520 --> 36:57.790
Yes. They're all waiting for orders
outside the residence.

36:57.800 --> 37:00.380
(Cultivate Virtue and Pursue Studies)

37:00.780 --> 37:03.740
(Cultivate Virtue and Pursue Studies)

37:04.352 --> 37:05.880
(Bu)
Bu's Soldiers, hear my command!

37:06.030 --> 37:06.760
- Yes!
- Yes!

37:07.400 --> 37:08.190
Move out!

37:34.550 --> 37:36.000
I'm warning you one last time.

37:36.880 --> 37:38.320
Do not interfere in anything.

37:39.110 --> 37:39.880
Do you really think

37:40.670 --> 37:42.590
I would give the throne to a mere child?

37:43.070 --> 37:44.000
In today's struggle,

37:44.550 --> 37:45.440
I will not back down.

37:45.550 --> 37:46.190
Fine.

37:46.480 --> 37:47.440
Today, except for you,

37:47.840 --> 37:49.030
everyone else will die here.

37:49.030 --> 37:53.550
♪How can you be this wonderful♪

37:55.551 --> 37:58.491
♪I've hidden so many words♪

37:59.111 --> 38:01.911
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

38:02.781 --> 38:09.751
♪So never uncover♪

38:09.941 --> 38:12.301
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

38:13.431 --> 38:16.161
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

38:17.121 --> 38:22.461
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

38:24.221 --> 38:27.041
♪Every answer I gave♪

38:27.841 --> 38:30.691
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

38:31.481 --> 38:34.851
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

38:35.111 --> 38:38.421
♪How hard it truly was?♪

38:41.391 --> 38:44.831
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

38:45.821 --> 38:48.151
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

38:49.421 --> 38:55.181
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

38:56.591 --> 38:59.721
♪It's a shame I never could♪

39:00.171 --> 39:03.181
♪Give you a moon in return♪

39:03.291 --> 39:09.931
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

39:09.931 --> 39:13.601
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

39:14.471 --> 39:17.231
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

39:17.671 --> 39:20.801
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

39:21.241 --> 39:27.191
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

39:28.591 --> 39:32.141
♪You'll never♪

39:32.421 --> 39:41.891
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪

40:08.061 --> 40:11.541
(No animals were harmed
in the making of this film)
